data: {"answer": "這裡是「湖邊草地・集合點與營運持續」房間，主要展示緊急集合點與營運持續計畫。\n可見的防護措施包括不斷電系統、發電機、滅火設備以及災難復原流程。\n此處強調在系統或電力出問題時，如何以人工方式替代並繼續營運渡假村。", "go": [], "followups": [{"text": "不斷電系統與發電機是做什麼的？", "en": "What does the UPS & Backup Generator do?", "zh": "不斷電系統與發電機是做什麼的？"}, {"text": "停電、火災與淹水要怎麼防？", "en": "How do we prevent power outage, fire & flood?", "zh": "停電、火災與淹水要怎麼防？"}, {"text": "接下來要去哪？", "en": "What should I do next?", "zh": "接下來要去哪？"}], "trace": {"session": "offline", "lang": "zh", "model": "qwen3.5:9b", "timings": {"route_s": 0.0, "tool_s": 0.01, "answer_s": 8.33, "total_s": 8.34}, "route": {"tool": "room_overview", "target": "", "how": "button"}, "link": {"query": "(current room)", "chosen": "lawn", "how": "current room"}, "redirect": "", "queries": [{"purpose": "everything placed in this room", "cypher": "MATCH (r:Room {key:$k}) RETURN r {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh} AS r, [(r)-[:IN_AREA]->(a) | a {.key, .name_en, .name_zh}][0] AS area, [(r)-[:CLOSEUP_OF]->(p) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh}][0] AS parent, [(s:System)-[:LOCATED_IN]->(r) | s {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS systems, [(t:Threat)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | t {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS threats, [(c:Control)-[:SEEN_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .type}] AS controls, [(c:Concept)-[:TAUGHT_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS concepts, [(p:Procedure)-[:PRACTISED_IN]->(r) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .kind}] AS procedures, [(d:Department)-[:BASED_IN]->(r) | d {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .ext}] AS departments, [(cs:CaseStudy)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | cs {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .year}] AS cases, [(r)-[l:LINKS_TO]->(x) | x {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh, teleport: l.teleport}] AS exits, size([(f:Finding)-[:IN_ROOM]->(r) | f]) AS findings_here", "params": {"k": "lawn"}, "rows": 1, "ms": 6.1}], "graph": {"nodes": [{"key": "lawn", "label": "Room", "en": "Lakeside Lawn", "zh": "湖邊草地"}, {"key": "power", "label": "System", "en": "UPS & Backup Generator", "zh": "不斷電系統與發電機"}, {"key": "environmental", "label": "Threat", "en": "Power Outage, Fire & Flood", "zh": "停電、火災與淹水"}, {"key": "bcp_dr", "label": "Control", "en": "Business Continuity & Disaster Recovery", "zh": "營運持續與災難復原"}, {"key": "environmental_protection", "label": "Control", "en": "UPS, Generator & Fire Suppression", "zh": "不斷電、發電機與滅火設備"}, {"key": "c_bcp", "label": "Concept", "en": "BCP, RTO & RPO", "zh": "營運持續、RTO 與 RPO"}], "edges": [{"a": "environmental_protection", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "lawn"}, {"a": "environmental_protection", "t": "PROTECTS", "b": "power"}, {"a": "environmental_protection", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "environmental"}, {"a": "power", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "lawn"}, {"a": "environmental", "t": "TARGETS", "b": "power"}, {"a": "environmental", "t": "SHOWN_IN", "b": "lawn"}, {"a": "c_bcp", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "lawn"}, {"a": "c_bcp", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "bcp_dr"}, {"a": "bcp_dr", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "lawn"}, {"a": "bcp_dr", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "environmental"}]}, "tool_used": "room_overview", "facts": "房間：湖邊草地・集合點與營運持續\n代表的資訊主題：緊急集合點；營運持續計畫寫著系統或電力出問題時渡假村怎麼繼續營運。\n重點：事先知道自己的工作在系統掛掉時怎麼用人工替代。\n這裡的系統：不斷電系統與發電機\n這裡要注意的威脅：停電、火災與淹水\n看得到的防護措施：營運持續與災難復原、不斷電、發電機與滅火設備\n課程概念：營運持續、RTO 與 RPO\n相關的處理流程：收銀系統當機\n可以走到：渡假村資訊系統地圖（導覽裡的名稱：熱氣球）、會館碼頭・進貨與廠商、泳池・資料湖、客人報到與無線網路（導覽裡的名稱：湖畔露台）", "answer_stats": {"model": "qwen3.5:9b", "wall_s": 8.33, "load_s": 0.01, "prompt_tokens": 624, "prompt_s": 2.48, "gen_tokens": 72, "gen_s": 5.74, "tok_per_s": 12.5, "first_token_s": 2.58}}, "state": {}}

